extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 15: Spirit West printed 60-62, read from the text layer. No hit point or S.D.C. formula is printed, so compose.js supplies both (1D6 S.D.C. as a practitioner of magic); the +20 S.D.C. is a pool bonus on top. I.S.P. prints as 3D6xlO and is read as 3D6x10; trade goods as 3D6x100 (BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT F53). Psionics: the book gives no tier and grants super powers, so master is stored. Level 1 grants five named Healing powers; level 2 grants all the remaining Healing powers, stored as the ten other Healing rows that cite Rifts Ultimate Edition - Attack Disease and Transfer I.S.P. carry no source in the catalog and are left out rather than granted on a guess. One Physical power (never Telekinesis) and one Sensitive power are gained at every level from 1, and one super power from the book''s list of eight at levels 3, 6, 9 and 12. The eight names use the catalog''s spellings (Bio-Manipulation (the evil eye)). Spells: Negate Poison/Toxin and Turn Dead at level one, then the book''s fixed healing spells at 3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13 and 15, plus one Shamanistic spell of any level per level, never a Paradox spell (list S). Play Musical Instrument is one catalog skill where the book grants two instruments. The totem pick is not stored; see BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT.md F56."
